MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T19:47:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T19:47:51Z","body":"It just means the autoload's name must be different from its `class_name`, the error text could be clearer tho. Autoload is an instance of that script, so its name and the `class_name` are different things.\n\nYou can even disable the global variable, this still will create the autoload from that script, but without assigning it a name. And basically create a normal singleton.\n```gdscript\nclass_name MyAutoloadClass\nstatic var singleton: MyAutoloadClass\n\nfunc _ready -> void:\n    if singleton: queue_free()\n    else: singleton = self\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5183842893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]